    "From the home screen, tap \"Pray the Rosary\" under today's mysteries, or tap any mystery in the grid below. On the page that opens, choose a meditation (a short reading on each mystery), or another way to pray: the Scriptural Rosary, with a Bible verse for every Hail Mary, or the Audio Rosary, where you listen and pray along. The next page shows how you'll pray, the audio and the counting, just above Pray." : {
      "comment" : "Help & Support: the answer to the question above it; names of buttons and settings must match the app's own words"
    },
